category: Libs
requires: libdnstable0 libmtbl-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Encoding format, library, and utilities for passive DNS data (development)"
ldesc: "dnstable implements an encoding format for passive DNS data. It consists of a
C library, libdnstable, and several command line utilities for creating,
querying, and merging dnstable data files."
external-source: dnstable

